units metal
dimension 3
boundary p p s
atom_style atomic
lattice bcc 3.3
region projectile block 0 20 0 20 0 20
region target block 0 20 0 20 21.5 61.5
create_box 1 projectile union target
create_atoms 1 region projectile
create_atoms 1 region target
pair_style eam
pair_coeff * * ../../../potentials/prompt1.potential Nb
mass 1 92.906
neighbor 2 bin
neigh_modify every 1 delay 0 check yes
velocity all create 300 12345 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix NVT all nvt temp 300 300 0.1
timestep 0.001
run 100000
unfix NVT
group projectile region projectile
velocity projectile set 0 0 2000 sum yes
fix NVE all nve
run 200000
